    [CI][Misc] Revert CANN 9.3.0 ops-transformer packages (#20309)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Reverts #20151 and removes the CANN 9.3.0 ops-transformer installation
    blocks from the A2, A3, and A5 Ubuntu/openEuler Dockerfiles.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This restores the Dockerfile behavior before #20151.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - Verified exactly one matching ops-transformer block was removed from
    each of the six Dockerfiles.
    - The revert commit is based on the latest upstream main.
    - Runtime image builds were not run locally because this host has no
    Ascend/NPU build environment.
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
    Signed-off-by: underfituu <hzhucong@163.com>

